@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: DXP Trial
	Testing the DXP Trial page.

Setup:
	* I go to the DXP Trial Sign In page
	* I generate a web user email address
	* I generate a web company name
	* I create a DXP trial account with a randomly generated email address and company name with the following additional values
	| Email        | ${staticEmailAddress}               |
	| Password     | testtest                            |
	| First Name   | DXP                                 |
	| Last Name    | Trialuser                           |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5555                        |
	| Company      | ${staticCompanyName}                |
	| Industry     | Automotive                          |
	| Country      | United States                       |
	| Region       | California                          |

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I get the web trial organziation id value with the name "${staticCompanyName}" belonging to the user with the email address "${staticEmailAddress}"
	* I tear down the users with the following email addresses from web.liferay.com
	| ${staticEmailAddress} |
	* I tear down the trial organization with the ID value "${staticTrialOrganizationIdValue}"

Scenario: View DXP Trial Page
	Trial users should be able to view the DXP Trial Homepage.

	* I should be able to the view the DXP Trial Homepage